> is a morphism in <MATH_0018>, and\n<MATH_0019> is a\nmorphism in <MATH_0020> such that\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0021> and <MATH_0022> induce the same morphism <MATH_0023>, and\n<STRUCT_0007> the diagram\n<MATH_0024>\nis commutative.\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009>\nThe functors <MATH_0025>\nand <MATH_0026> are the\nforgetful functors in this case. The transformation <MATH_0027> is given on the object <MATH_0028> by\n<MATH_0029>.\n<STRUCT_0010>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7891914cbc58fa48287dc991a25a8060895716462ef47fafa79e6db5c37c44af", "unit_id": "inventory:categories:0040:lemma/0001"}, "state": "READY"}, "reference:categories-lemma-2-product-fibred-categories-over-C": {"context_hash": "sha256:16d774ee14eaba25848b5025ece87d46cfa1ee453f9376c7b31a39219b7776b1", "kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 229164, "byte_start": 228897, "file": "categories.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3bd83f783290607684c6a01b01ad46eea90ce0c10a48a7d4b9b7fd4ad844b87f", "line_end": 6564, "line_start": 6557}, "owner_tag": "02XQ", "parent_tag": "02XJ", "requested_label": "categories-lemma-2-product-fibred-categories-over-C", "requested_tag": "02XQ", "semantic_path": "lemma/0001", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02XJ", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-2-product-fibred-categories-over-C}", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$(2, 1)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-2-product-categories-over-C}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b670d7b1eb79e7fca4fe89abfcc89f8f63cab334fe0ead2621d4cff8c8da5b04", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d3ee8751898bd73fc7a37b25b01c1682f64f6482a5126e3356b9e25aa8